OL,3,GNEWSARapist police officer was first
OL,4,Aarrested and released 17 years ago
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former police sergeant convicted of
OL,7,Frape was first arrested 17 years ago
OL,8,Ffollowing a complaint from one of his
OL,9,Fvictims.
OL,11,FCampbell Petrie, 50, is facing a
OL,12,Flengthy jail sentence after being found
OL,13,Fguilty of sex offences and violence
OL,14,Fagainst two women between 2006 and
OL,15,F2022.
OL,17,FPolice Scotland told BBC News that one
OL,18,Fof the women, who he met through his
OL,19,Fjob, made a complaint of threatening
OL,20,Fbehaviour against Petrie in 2009.
